    <briefdescription>
<para>Comparator that orders <computeroutput>pre_spair*</computeroutput> pointers by the <computeroutput>quot</computeroutput> varpower monomial of each pre-S-pair. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses <computeroutput><ref refid="class_exponent_list_a39cea8f841c34eb30580a2318ac22ec4_1a39cea8f841c34eb30580a2318ac22ec4" kindref="member">varpower_monomials::compare</ref></computeroutput> directly and keeps a single <computeroutput><ref refid="class_pre_s_pair_sorter_a2304dc45b15f4aa2a86156ee21cf0751_1a2304dc45b15f4aa2a86156ee21cf0751" kindref="member">ncmps</ref></computeroutput> profiling counter. Applied during S-pair generation, before the pre-pairs are promoted to full <computeroutput><ref refid="structspair" kindref="compound">spair</ref></computeroutput>s. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
